@{
   ViewData["Title"] = "Hello!";
}

@* @ViewBag.Name reads the value the controller stuffed into ViewBag.
    Note: Nothing here checks that "Name" was actually set -
    if the controller forgot to set it, this just renders blank.  That fragility
    is exactly why Activity 2 moves us to strongly-typed models.*@

<h2>Hello, @ViewBag.Name! </h2>
<p> This value came from the URL segment, through the controller, into this view. </p>